  "description": "The application proposals comprise internal amalgamation of existing 7 commercial units to create 4 new units to be used as a mixture of business uses of varying sizes with one larger business premises (291sqm) centrally located across basement, ground and upper floors adjacent to the station ticket hall, replacement of all shopfronts, first floor windows and rooflights, alterations to the unit 181 former Tea Room space including removal of disused windows, replacement of flooring and replacement of internal staircases. External frontage restoration and refurbishment of the existing station canopy, provision of new replica station clock and decorative urns and renewal of all roof finishes including provision of new slate tile and lead roofing to pitch roof areas is also included. (No's 175-185 Praed Street)",
